{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7b5fba4f22036b1b9eea75d16101c7ca6b1173bf7b1b2d2b1aff73eab7fff1f4","ja":"たくさんのお魚さん達が、優雅に泳いでいますね～。\nキラキラ光って、とっても綺麗です～♪","zh":"许多鱼儿们正在优雅地游来游去呢～。\n闪闪发光的，真是漂亮极了～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"dba9a002ce124a08ac256c2da7da9feefc1733f3c80ad8d5280736dcb4e1b934","ja":"（……朋花ちゃんって、水槽を見上げてるだけで\n絵になるなあ。やっぱり、大人っぽくって……）","zh":"（……朋花光是抬头看着水族箱，就很有画面感啊。果然很有大人范儿……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8403c82d1533b842150d27cb59a4e7ce5322ed12048eca768ad110eb49c4edb4","ja":"……可憐さん？　どうかしましたか～？","zh":"……可怜？怎么了吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8d8fce867718f15a5b03c51c95de7d003a6a9a90fc7b60095a9be3b2e91baa56","ja":"あっ……ううん。ただ……やっぱり朋花ちゃんって、\n大人っぽいな、って……。","zh":"啊……没什么。只是……我还是觉得，朋花很有大人的感觉……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4a042083d11c36d980d2a3c199e854f2efbc089fe89daa7110b096b79022ba11","ja":"お、お仕事のときも、そう思ったけど、\n水槽を見つめるところが、とっても……。","zh":"我、我在工作的时候也这么觉得，\n盯着水族箱看的样子，真的非常……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"be6804141df1471ea6fb7212e665cfe3e8d1239aaaca63724e0e9291b891fd52","ja":"ありがとうございます～。\nでも、私はまだ中学生ですから～。","zh":"谢谢您～  \n不过，我还只是初中生～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"075dae4491f8d584568134c81edecf414aa8dc639faa1d3b74f9dc3bbb71cbaf","ja":"それより、他のところも見て回りましょう～。","zh":"比起这个，我们去看看其他地方吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"0d09ab96db2f714a42de95f905713672f0ce8cd5e29859d2bc2ead7aa41e588a","ja":"ふたりは、館内を巡った後、\nイルカショーに行って……","zh":"两人逛了一圈馆内后，去看了海豚表演……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9d6e309d1d3f1b96a55a7c107ad442fee9b623eb434ef0548b5439ce581a536b","ja":"あの海豚ちゃん、ショップで見つけたぬいぐるみに\nそっくりですね～。とっても、かわいいです～♪","zh":"那只海豚宝宝，和在商店里看到的毛绒玩偶一模一样呢～。可爱极了～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e094648c29b74783b3a3d990364fde557c7e220ee793f881089b97e36e428c31","ja":"（あ……今の朋花ちゃんの笑顔、かわいい……。\nこうしてると、やっぱり中学生なんだ……♪）","zh":"（啊……刚才朋花的笑容，好可爱……\n这样一看，果然还是初中生呢……♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"eb02601fcf93872489815337ae28c5bde9d3891ae959e1598cf03c5c98ac4110","ja":"や、やっぱり……ぬいぐるみ、お迎えしにいく？\n朋花ちゃん、すごく……気に入ってたみたいだし。","zh":"要、要不还是……去把那只玩偶接回来？朋花好像特别……喜欢它。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"56e7fd7b623df8ebba75e90f11426540de0350e091d85518b429d735dbefeb74","ja":"そうですね～……。\nもう一度、ショップに寄ってもいいでしょうか～。","zh":"对呢～……。\n可以再去一趟商店吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"3d3b1ab4f2676b5b190f68972b298b953de1e5085536fa1aec56c4587ec592c7","ja":"も、もちろん。それじゃあ、これから……。\nあ、あれっ？　ハンカチが……ない……！？","zh":"当、当然。那么，接下来……  \n啊、咦？手帕……不见了……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"120d23fa982098a55c832dcc7fda635b4cb8cb416a7242025892f6d3bfc7982a","ja":"さっきお休みしたベンチに、忘れてきたのかも\nしれませんね～。一緒に戻りましょう～。","zh":"可能是忘在刚才休息过的长椅上了呢～。我们一起回去吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1778.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4b8b28522d1bb7f8948d16946632b473292439825a0253b1423f57fa63b35149","ja":"だ、大丈夫……先にショップへ行ってて……！\nわ、私……すぐ、取ってくるから。","zh":"没、没关系……你先去商店吧……！\n我、我……马上就去拿回来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
